<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Commentary/Info</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>My obligatory fungal/contagion and tale/SCP article, cast from an admittedly heavily and dense medical perspective, which I understand is a strength and a weakness that I own, but that I also try to ride the margins of. I understand the CSS theme, the offsets, the technicality of the work will be a turn off for many. Your viewpoints are justified and understood. I am who I am however and <a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/preface-to-practical-logopsychology/">my very favorite</a> <a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/time-travel">works</a> are those in pockets of severely technical niche-work, and I am accepting of the relative unconcern that comes with it.</p>
<p>In the hands of an author who isn’t a pathological provocateur, this would have been a normal SCP and an offset of separately-published tales.</p>
<hr />
<p>Thanks to:<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534365548" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;">Ihp</a></span>, for his crit and Listpages help, as well as <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1173523); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1173523&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534365548" alt="Eskobar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1173523)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1173523); return false;">Eskobar</a></span> for his crit.<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534365548" alt="Croquembouche" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;">Croquembouche</a></span> for <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">guiding</span> admonishing me on the css wrapper, as well as their newly released <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/listpages-magic-and-you">ListPages Magic and You</a>, without which I'm sure I would have fumbled the posting of this.<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534365548" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;">The Great Hippo</a></span> for use of the faded Foundation Logo on offset 1.<br />
