<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1705184&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534365548" alt="Mortos" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1705184)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mortos" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1705184); return false;">Mortos</a></span> for his <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/mortos-collapsible">work on collapsibles</a>, made aware to me via <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mathbrush" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2026461); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2026461&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534365548" alt="MathBrush" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2026461)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mathbrush" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2026461); return false;">MathBrush</a></span> and his <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/4000contestmathbrush">4k contest entry</a>.<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534365548" alt="FloppyPhoenix" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;">FloppyPhoenix</a></span> for the Pataphysics CSS wrapper, which is here modified in hue.</p>
<p>If I have failed to thank you and you deserve thanks, please let me know in a PM. If you are embarrassed by my mentioning you here and wish your name to be removed from this, definitely please PM me about it.</p>
